{
  "title": "BYPASS 的响应没有落盘（nginx/1.31.5 实测）",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si -H 'Pragma: no-cache' localhost/?v=2 | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: BYPASS"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "带 Pragma 头：读缓存被跳过"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/?v=2 | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: MISS"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "若 BYPASS 落了盘这里应是 HIT——MISS 证明没落盘"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/?v=2 | grep X-Proxy-Cache"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "X-Proxy-Cache: HIT"}
  ]
}
